{"title":"2009 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10B Problems\">2009 AMC 10B #6</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Problems\">2009 AMC 12B #5</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~1:10)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:10)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Kiana has two older twin brothers.  The product of their three ages is 128.  What is the sum of their three ages?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/c/5fcfb154d8959ebc740df8ff1115802b795c417d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 10\\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 12\\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 16\\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 18\\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The age of each person is a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f5fe435e1ce1fcf87a236b1e7a8b9d5f6d687b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$128 = 2^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />.  So the twins could be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/1/72113c07dfa96f0590003eec4c4e2c22663cff9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^0 = 1, 2^1 = 2, 2^2 = 4, 2^3 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"223\" height=\"18\" /> years of age and, consequently Kiana could be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0aed56990dedba5a88a65e21245ccfd5d5e43ae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$128$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years old, respectively.  Because Kiana is younger than her brothers, she must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years old. So the sum of their ages is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/2/2b2e51e949008d1fdceffc3c46abb2d44c2880f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 8 + 8 = \\boxed{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"126\" height=\"23\" />.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfbf4df7c25681bb178ddc50ee0c0d656aa25b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_.28Logical.2C_Good_Editing.2C_.7E1:10.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~1:10)\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:10)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:10)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/HKgrdBgN5DE\">https://www.youtube.com/shorts/HKgrdBgN5DE</a>\n</p><p>~Ebai\n</p><p>Note: the problem where this is linked is the second problem covered (1:20-2:30)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jgyyGeEKhwk?t=25\">https://youtu.be/jgyyGeEKhwk?t=25</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/F8k7r3LDXoA\">https://youtu.be/F8k7r3LDXoA</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B\" title=\"2009 AMC 10B\">2009 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?ti